Lession 6:- What is React?

--> React is a JS library used to create user interfaces. 
--> Instead of writing one enormous page, React allows us to divide the interface into smaller reusable components. 

--> For example, a website could have: 
Website
│
├── Navbar
│   ├── Logo
│   └── NavigationLinks
│
├── MainContent
│   ├── HeroSection
│   └── ProductList
│       ├── ProductCard
│       └── ProductCard
│
└── Footer

--> Each section can be its own component. 

--> Why use components? 

-Reuse code.
-Make projects easier to maintain. 
-Separate different UI sections. 
-Update individuals sections without rebuilding the entire interface manually. 


